        {
            "title": "貝森特支持向美國人發放5000美元支票的提議 稱可以不影響財赤",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">【彭博】-- 美國財政部長<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":0,\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\",\"ySubModuleName\":\"anchor_text\"}' data-ylk=\"elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;subsec:anchor_text;\" href=\"https://hk.news.yahoo.com/tag/貝森特\" rel=\"\">貝森特</a>表示，他支持總統川普提出的如果共和黨中期選舉後在國會繼續保持多數席位，就向美國成年人發放5000美元支票的計畫。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":0,\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\",\"ySubModuleName\":\"anchor_text\"}' data-ylk=\"elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;subsec:anchor_text;\" href=\"https://hk.news.yahoo.com/tag/貝森特\" rel=\"\">貝森特</a>在周二回應議員有關該計畫的提問時表示：「我認為有辦法在不影響赤字的情況下做到這一點。」</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">在眾議院金融服務委員會聽證會上，貝森特沒有說明如何抵消相關成本，但表示財政部已經為這一計畫籌備了「相當長一段時間」。他沒有承認此類付款很可能需要獲得國會授權。如果確實如此，貝森特表示，他將與眾議院議長邁克·約翰遜就這項提案展開合作。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-913fcfc0-363a-37e8-aa97-d6f296f107b8-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">貝森特說：「讓美國人民口袋裡有更多錢，應該是所有人的目標。」他稱總統推動這項計畫的意願「非常認真」。</p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[92px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:h-[120px] lg:w-[calc(50%-16px)]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[92px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:h-[120px] lg:w-[calc(50%-16px)]\"></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">這項提議預計耗資超過1萬億美元，而美國今年的支出預計將比稅收和關稅收入高出約2萬億美元。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">參議院多數黨領袖圖恩周二也在國會大廈對記者表示，金融市場和美國債務目前的情況「確實令人擔憂」。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">被問及發放5000美元支票的計畫時，圖恩表示：「在決定如何花錢時，我們必須非常審慎和明智，同時也要想方設法努力放緩政府支出的成長速度。」</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">原文標題Bessent Says He's Supportive of $5,000 Checks for Americans</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">--聯合報導 Steven T. Dennis.</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">More stories like this are available on <a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"bloomberg.com\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:bloomberg.com;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://www.bloomberg.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">bloomberg.com</a></p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">©2026 Bloomberg L.P.</p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E8%B2%9D%E6%A3%AE%E7%89%B9%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81%E5%90%91%E7%BE%8E%E5%9C%8B%E4%BA%BA%E7%99%BC%E6%94%BE5000%E7%BE%8E%E5%85%83%E6%94%AF%E7%A5%A8%E7%9A%84%E6%8F%90%E8%AD%B0-%E7%A8%B1%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8D%E5%BD%B1%E9%9F%BF%E8%B2%A1%E8%B5%A4-163732240.html",
